+          <t indent="0" pn="section-1.2.1-6">GSS_S_BAD_MIC indicates that the received P-IDU contains an incorrect integrity field (e.g., signature or MAC) for the data.</t>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-1.2.1-7">GSS_S_COMPLETE indicates that the requested operation was successful.</t>
