+          <t indent="0" pn="section-1.2.1-22">IDUP_S_MORE_OUTBUFFER_NEEDED (I) indicates that the output buffer supplied is too small to hold the generated data.  The application should continue calling this routine (until GSS_S_COMPLETE is returned) in order to get all remaining output data.</t>
