-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.1-1">The set of calls described in this section is used in place of the
-calls GSS_GetMIC(), GSS_VerifyMIC, GSS_Wrap(), and GSS_Unwrap() which
-are specified in <xref target="RFC-2078" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC-2078"/>, since those calls are specific to a
-session-oriented environment.</t>
