+      -- may be empty
+]]></artwork>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.2-30">Using the security environment referenced by env_handle, initialize the data structures required to begin the process of decrypting and/or verifying the PIDU (which will be supplied in multiple buffers to the Process_Buffer call).</t>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.2-31">The parameters sign_qop_alg_in and sig_token should not both be supplied (i.e., they should not both be non-NULL).  If they are both non-NULL, however, sig_token is taken to be authoritative since this is the token created at protection time and therefore is guaranteed to carry the information needed to unprotect.</t>
